#: ../../../docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:8
msgid "当前架构图册"
msgstr "Current architecture diagrams"

#: ../../../docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:10
msgid ""
"图源为可编辑 DOT，输出为本地 SVG；`labels.json` 维护同一拓扑的中英文标签。 实线和虚线以各边标签为准，不能把源码依赖理解为每次 "
"I/O 的转发，也不能由图推导 软件候选、吞吐、低功耗或物理 HIL。当前 MCU 接入只有 F4，精确实现限定 F407VE／ZG。"
msgstr ""
"Editable DOT sources produce local SVG files; `labels.json` maintains "
"English and Chinese labels for the same topology. Read solid and dashed "
"edges by their labels: a source dependency does not imply forwarding on each"
" I/O call, and diagrams do not establish software candidates, throughput, "
"low-power behavior or physical HIL. Current MCU integration is F4 only, with"
" concrete implementations limited to F407VE/ZG."

#: ../../../docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:14
msgid ""
"纯退役芯片图已退出当前图册，原图可从 [固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/assets/diagrams)"
" 追溯。机器身份与范围见 {download}`diagram-index.csv <diagram-index.csv>`，原始执行证据不重标。"
msgstr ""
"Diagrams dedicated to retired chips have left the current gallery. Their "
"originals remain traceable at the [fixed prior "
"source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/assets/diagrams)."
" Machine identities and scope are in {download}`diagram-index.csv <diagram-"
"index.csv>`; original execution evidence is not relabeled."

#: ../../../docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:18
msgid "修改图源或标签后，使用已准备锁定工具重新生成并验证；渲染检查不代替独立语义审查。"
msgstr ""
"After editing sources or labels, regenerate and verify with the prepared "
"locked tools. Render checks do not replace independent semantic review."

